cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "NMTC Application Builder"
abstract: >
  An open-source intelligence platform for Community Development Entities (CDEs)
  preparing New Markets Tax Credit (NMTC) allocation applications to the CDFI Fund.
  Scores applications against the CDFI Fund's published CY 2024-2025 Review Process
  criteria (Business Strategy, Community Outcomes, Priority Points), generates
  quantified recommendations with CDFI Fund citations, optimizes project subsets,
  and produces automated Word/Excel/PDF/Markdown application packages.
